    <h1>The partner agreement, <em>in plain English</em></h1>
    <p>This is a reference copy of the agreement partners sign when they join the referral program. The copy you sign adds your business details and my countersignature, and the terms below govern the relationship. I publish it so you can read every line before we talk.</p>
